~ warden
Warden: The causeway is open, but the old ruin is still dangerous.
- I can help with the prowlers. [if not flags.get("accepted_1", false) /]
	do accept_quest(1)
	Warden: Defeat two. We will hear of it when it is done.
	=> END
- Tell me about the buried light. [if completed(1) /]
	do accept_quest(2)
	Warden: Follow the causeway east. Keys in the ruin open its sealed passages.
	=> END
- I want to learn alchemy.
	do accept_quest(3)
	Warden: Two silverleaf sprigs make one restorative draught.
	=> END
- Goodbye.
	=> END
